cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository, please cite the manuscript it accompanies (see
  `preferred-citation`). Zenodo is the authoritative archival location for the
  paper; this repository is the reproducibility and verification companion
  only. The concept DOI 10.5281/zenodo.20665588 always resolves to the latest
  version of the manuscript. The specific deposited version whose identities
  this repository reproduces is 10.5281/zenodo.20672985.
title: >-
  Reproducibility companion: shared quarter-gamma lattice and the limits of the
  Thales-Ramanujan analogy
abstract: >-
  Symbolic and arbitrary-precision verification of the exact identities in
  "Ramanujan's Formula for 1/pi and the Thales Integral Witness", together with
  the demonstrated obstruction at which the analogy stops. Covers the
  quarter-parameter coefficient lattice, the Thales beta family and its gamma
  strata, the conjugate-stratum reflection product, the lemniscatic period
  relation, arcsine and central-binomial moments, the mirror-tilt diagnostic,
  the Clausen parameter obstruction for the tested generating functions, and
  the digamma/trigamma parameter-response hierarchy.
